    <string name="calc_tips_title">Quick tips</string>
    <string name="calc_tips">• ^ short press squares; long press enters the exponent (highlighted), long press again leaves it.\n• Typing a letter creates a variable; =[] turns the line into an equation and = solves it.\n• ⊕= adds another equation to solve a system.\n• Tap any box (case) to fill it; ⇥ jumps to the next empty box.\n• Brackets change ( ) → [ ] → { } automatically with nesting.\n• Long press sin/cos/tan for the inverse, √ for the n-th root, a letter for upper case.\n• ∫ with empty limits gives the antiderivative (+ C).</string>
